      "text": "Câu 17: The Single European Act of 1987:\nA. reduced competition in most industries. B. eliminated competition in many industries.\n[IMAGE] C. reduced efficiency in most industries. D. increased competition in most industries.",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">17:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The Single European Act of 1987:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>reduced competition in most industries.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>eliminated competition in many industries.</p>\n<p><img class=\"card-image\" src=\"data/media/image3.png\" alt=\"Hinh cau hoi\"><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>reduced efficiency in most industries.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increased competition in most industries.</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">17:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The Single European Act of 1987:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>reduced competition in most industries.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>eliminated competition in many industries.</p>\n<p><img class=\"card-image\" src=\"data/media/image3.png\" alt=\"Hinh cau hoi\"><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>reduced efficiency in most industries.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increased competition in most industries.</p>"
