      "title": "Câu 19:",
      "context": "TCQT_C1",
      "text": "Câu 19: Which of the following is an example of direct foreign investment?\nA. exporting to a country.\nB. establishing licensing arrangements in a country.\nC. purchasing existing companies in a country\nD. investing directly (without brokers) in foreign stocks",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">19:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is an example of direct foreign investment?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>exporting to a country.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>establishing licensing arrangements in a country.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>purchasing existing companies in a country</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>investing directly (without brokers) in foreign stocks</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">19:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is an example of direct foreign investment?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>exporting to a country.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>establishing licensing arrangements in a country.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>purchasing existing companies in a country</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>investing directly (without brokers) in foreign stocks</p>"
