      "title": "Câu 20:",
      "context": "TCQT_C1",
      "text": "Câu 20: According to the text, a disadvantage of licensing is that:\nA. it prevents a firm from importing.\nB. it is difficult to ensure quality control of the production process.\nC. it prevents a firm from exporting.\nD. none of the above",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">20: </span>According to the text, a disadvantage of licensing is that:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>it prevents a firm from importing.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>it is difficult to ensure quality control of the production process.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>it prevents a firm from exporting.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">20: </span>According to the text, a disadvantage of licensing is that:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>it prevents a firm from importing.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>it is difficult to ensure quality control of the production process.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>it prevents a firm from exporting.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>"
