      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">23:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is not mentioned in the text as a constraint interfering with the MNC goal?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>economic constraints.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>environmental constraints</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>regulatory constraints.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>ethical constraints.</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">23:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is not mentioned in the text as a constraint interfering with the MNC goal?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"u\">economic</span><span class=\"u\"> </span><span class=\"u\">constraints.</span><span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>environmental constraints</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>regulatory constraints.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>ethical constraints.</p>"
