      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">24:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is not a provision or result of the Single European Act of 1987?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increased regulatory uniformity among European countries.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>the phasing in of a common currency for all European countries by 1992</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>the removal of many taxes on goods traded between European countries</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>firms&#x27; ability to achieve economies of scale.</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">24:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is not a provision or result of the Single European Act of 1987?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increased regulatory uniformity among European countries.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>the phasing in of a common currency for all European countries by 1992</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>the removal of many taxes on goods traded between European countries</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>firms&#x27; ability to achieve economies of scale.</p>"
