      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">44:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The most risky method(s) by which firms conduct international business is (are):</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(A) Franchising.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(B) The acquisitions of existing operations.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(C) The establishment of new subsidiaries.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(D) B and C only.</p>"
