      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">49:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>In a highly global market, many companies seek to expand their markets to other foreign countries when their domestic market becomes mature. Which of the following theories suggest this fact?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>product cycle theory.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>imperfect markets theory.</p>\n<p><img class=\"card-image\" src=\"data/media/image3.png\" alt=\"Hinh cau hoi\"><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>theory of comparative advantage.</p>"
