      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">7:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>If the home currency begins to appreciate against other currencies, this should <span class=\"u\">  </span>the current account balance, other things equal (assume that substitutes are readily available in the countries, and that the prices charged by firms remain the same).</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>have no impact on    <span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increase<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>reduce    <span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of the above are equally possible</p>"
