      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">42:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is not likely to represent a strategy by the government of Country X to reduce its balance of trade deficit with Country Y?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The government of Country X eliminates environmental restrictions.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The government of Country X subsidizes firms in its country to facilitate dumping</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The government of Country X provides tax breaks to firms in specific industries.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The government of Country X removes a tariff on goods imported from Country Y</p>"
