      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">43:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following statements is not true?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Exporters commonly complain that they are being mistreated because the currency of their country is too weak</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Outsourcing affects the balance of trade because it means that a service is purchased in another country.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Sometimes, trade policies are used to punish countries for various actions.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Tariffs imposed by the EU have caused some friction between EU countries that commonly import products and other EU countries.</p>"
