      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 39: </span>If companies can rely on stock markets to obtain funds, they will have to rely more heavily on the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>market to raise longterm funds.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>derivative<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>long-term credit<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>money<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>foreign exchange</p>"
