      "text": "Câu 50: Assume that the spot rate of the Singapore dollar is $.664. The ADR of a Singapore firm is convertible into 3 shares of stock. The price of an ADR is $20. What is the share price of the firm in Singapore dollars?\nA. 10 B. 13.28 C. 30.12 D. 39.84",
