      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">18:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Assume that the U.S. places a strict quota on goods imported from Chile and that Chile does not retaliate. Holding other factors constant, this event should immediately cause the U.S. demand for Chilean pesos to <span class=\"tab\"></span>and the value of the peso to</p>\n<p><span class=\"tab\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increase; increase<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increase; decline<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>decline; decline<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>decline; increase</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">18:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Assume that the U.S. places a strict quota on goods imported from Chile and that Chile does not retaliate. Holding other factors constant, this event should immediately cause the U.S. demand for Chilean pesos to <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>and the value of the peso to</p>\n<p><span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increase; increase<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>increase; decline<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>decline; decline<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>decline; increase</p>"
