      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">6:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>In the U.S., the typical currency futures contract is based on a currency value in terms of:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>euros.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>U.S. dollars.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>British pounds.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Canadian dollars.</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">6:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>In the U.S., the typical currency futures contract is based on a currency value in terms of:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>euros.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>U.S. dollars.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>British pounds.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Canadian dollars.</p>"
