      "text": "Câu 9: Forward contracts:\nA. contain a commitment to the owner, and are standardized.\nB. contain a commitment to the owner, and can be tailored to the desire of the owner.\nC. contain a right but not a commitment to the owner, and can be tailored to the desire of the owner.\nD. contain a right but not a commitment to the owner, and are standardized.",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">9:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Forward contracts:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a commitment to the owner, and are standardized.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a commitment to the owner, and can be tailored to the desire of the owner.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a right but not a commitment to the owner, and can be tailored to the desire of the owner.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a right but not a commitment to the owner, and are standardized.</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">9:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Forward contracts:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a commitment to the owner, and are standardized.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a commitment to the owner, and can be tailored to the desire of the owner.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a right but not a commitment to the owner, and can be tailored to the desire of the owner.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>contain a right but not a commitment to the owner, and are standardized.</p>"
