      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 15: </span>The greater the variability of a currency, the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>will be the premium of a call option on this currency, and the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>will be the premium of a put option on this currency, other things equal.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>greater; lower<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>greater; greater<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>lower; greater<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>lower; lower</p>"
