      "title": "Câu 34:",
      "context": "TCQT_C5",
      "text": "Câu 34: You purchase a call option on pounds for a premium of $.03 per unit, with an exercise price of $1.64; the option will not be exercised until the expiration date, if at all. If the spot rate on the expiration date is $1.65, your net profit per unit is:\nA. −$.03. B. −$.02. C. −$.01. D. $.02.",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">34:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>You purchase a call option on pounds for a premium of $.03 per unit, with an exercise price of $1.64; the option will not be exercised until the expiration date, if at all. If the spot rate on the expiration date is $1.65, your net profit per unit is:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>−$.03.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>−$.02.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>−$.01.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>$.02.</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">34:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>You purchase a call option on pounds for a premium of $.03 per unit, with an exercise price of $1.64; the option will not be exercised until the expiration date, if at all. If the spot rate on the expiration date is $1.65, your net profit per unit is:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>−$.03.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>−$.02.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>−$.01.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>$.02.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b i\">SOLUTION:</span><span class=\"b i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">Net</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">profit</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">per</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">unit</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">=</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">$1.65</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">−</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">$1.64</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">−</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">$.03</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">=</span><span class=\"i\"> </span><span class=\"i\">−$.02.</span></p>"
