      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">39:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Macomb Corporation is a U.S. firm that invoices some of its exports in Japanese yen. If it expects the yen to weaken, it could</p>\n<p><span class=\"tab\"></span>to hedge the exchange rate risk on those exports.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>sell yen put options<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>buy yen call options</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>buy futures contracts on yen<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>sell futures contracts on yen</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">39:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Macomb Corporation is a U.S. firm that invoices some of its exports in Japanese yen. If it expects the yen to weaken, it could</p>\n<p><span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>to hedge the exchange rate risk on those exports.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>sell yen put options<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>buy yen call options</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>buy futures contracts on yen<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>sell futures contracts on yen</p>"
