      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 2: </span>Due to <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>, market forces should realign the spot rate of a currency among banks.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>forward realignment arbitrage<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>triangular arbitrage</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>covered interest arbitrage<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>locational arbitrage</p>"
