      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">31:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>You just received a gift from a friend consisting of 1,000 Thai baht, which you would like to exchange for Australian dollars (A$). You observe that exchange rate quotes for the baht are currently $.023, while quotes for the Australian dollar are $.576. How many Australian dollars should you expect to receive for your baht?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>A$39.93<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B. </span>A$25,043.48.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>A$25,043.48.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>"
