      "context": "TCQT_C6",
      "text": "Câu 34: If quoted exchange rates are the same across different locations, then is not feasible\nA. (A) triangular arbitrage B. (B) covered interest arbitrage\nC. (C) locational arbitrage D. A and C",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">34: </span>If quoted exchange rates are the same across different locations, then <span class=\"tab\"></span>is not feasible</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(A) triangular arbitrage<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(B) covered interest arbitrage</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>(C) locational arbitrage<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>A and C</p>",
