      "text": "Câu 23: Assume that the U.S. inflation rate rate is higher than the New Zealand inflation rate. This will cause U.S. consumers to their imports from New Zealand and New Zealand consumers to their imports from the U.S. According to purchasing power parity (PPP), this will result in a(n) of the New Zealand dollar (NZ$).\nA. reduce; increase; appreciation B. increase; reduce; appreciation\nC. reduce; increase; depreciation D. reduce; increase; appreciation",
