      "index": 372,
      "title": "Câu 30:",
      "context": "TCQT_C7",
      "text": "Câu 30: Which of the following theories suggests that the percentage difference between the forward rate and the spot rate depends on the interest rate differential between two countries?\nA. purchasing power parity (PPP) B. triangular arbitrage\n[IMAGE] C. international Fisher effect (IFE) D. interest rate parity (IRP).",
