      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">1:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following forecasting techniques would best represent the use of today&#x27;s forward exchange rate to forecast the future exchange rate?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>fundamental forecasting<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>market-based forecasting</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>technical forecasting.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>mixed forecasting</p>"
