      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">6:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>According to the text, the analysis of currencies forecasted with use of the forward rate suggests that:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>currencies exhibited about the same mean forecast errors as a percent of the realized value</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>the Canadian dollar can be forecasted by U.S. firms with greater accuracy than other currencies</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>the Swiss franc can be forecasted by U.S. firms with greater accuracy than other currencies</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>"
