      "context": "TCQT_C8",
      "text": "Câu 7: If it was determined that the movement of exchange rates was not related to previous exchange rate values, this implies that a\nis not valuable for speculating on expected exchange rate movements\nA. technical forecast technique B. fundamental forecast technique\nC. all of the above D. none of the above",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">7:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>If it was determined that the movement of exchange rates was not related to previous exchange rate values, this implies that a</p>\n<p><span class=\"tab\"></span>is not valuable for speculating on expected exchange rate movements</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>technical forecast technique<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>fundamental forecast technique</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of the above<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>",
