      "text": "Câu 24: Severus Co. has to pay 5 million Canadian dollars for supplies it recently received from Canada. Today, the Canadian dollar has appreciated by 2 percent against the U.S. dollar. Severus has determined that whenever the Canadian dollar appreciates against the\nU.S. dollar by more than 1 percent, it experiences a reversal of 40 percent on the following day. Based on this information, the Canadian dollar is expected to tomorrow, and Severus would prefer to make payment\nA. depreciate by .8%; today B. depreciate by .8%; tomorrow\nC. appreciate by .8%; today D. appreciate by .8%; tomorrow",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 24: </span>Severus Co. has to pay 5 million Canadian dollars for supplies it recently received from Canada. Today, the Canadian dollar has appreciated by 2 percent against the U.S. dollar. Severus has determined that whenever the Canadian dollar appreciates against the</p>\n<p>U.S. dollar by more than 1 percent, it experiences a reversal of 40 percent on the following day. Based on this information, the Canadian dollar is expected to <span class=\"tab\"></span>tomorrow, and Severus would prefer to make payment <span class=\"tab\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>depreciate by .8%; today<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>depreciate by .8%; tomorrow</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>appreciate by .8%; today<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>appreciate by .8%; tomorrow</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 24: </span>Severus Co. has to pay 5 million Canadian dollars for supplies it recently received from Canada. Today, the Canadian dollar has appreciated by 2 percent against the U.S. dollar. Severus has determined that whenever the Canadian dollar appreciates against the</p>\n<p>U.S. dollar by more than 1 percent, it experiences a reversal of 40 percent on the following day. Based on this information, the Canadian dollar is expected to <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>tomorrow, and Severus would prefer to make payment <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>depreciate by .8%; today<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>depreciate by .8%; tomorrow</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>appreciate by .8%; today<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>appreciate by .8%; tomorrow</p>"
