      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 28: </span>If a foreign country&#x27;s interest rate is similar to the U.S. rate, the forward rate premium or discount will be <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>, meaning that the forward rate and spot rate will provide <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>forecasts</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>substantial; similar<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>substantial; very different</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>close to zero; similar<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>close to zero; very different</p>"
