      "text": "Câu 34: Monson Co., based in the U.S., exports products to Japan denominated in yen. If the forecasted value of the yen is substantially than the forward rate, Monson Co. will likely decide the payments\nA. higher; to hedge B. lower; not to hedge C. higher; not to hedge D. none of the above",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">34:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Monson Co., based in the U.S., exports products to Japan denominated in yen. If the forecasted value of the yen is substantially <span class=\"tab\"></span>than the forward rate, Monson Co. will likely decide <span class=\"tab\"></span>the payments</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>higher; to hedge<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>lower; not to hedge<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>higher; not to hedge<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">34:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Monson Co., based in the U.S., exports products to Japan denominated in yen. If the forecasted value of the yen is substantially <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>than the forward rate, Monson Co. will likely decide <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>the payments</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>higher; to hedge<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>lower; not to hedge<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>higher; not to hedge<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>"
