      "context": "TCQT_C8",
      "text": "Câu 36: Purchasing power parity is used in:\nA. technical forecasting B. fundamental forecasting\nC. market-based accounting. D. all of the above",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">36:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Purchasing power parity is used in:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>technical forecasting<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>fundamental forecasting</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>market-based accounting.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of the above</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">36:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Purchasing power parity is used in:</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>technical forecasting<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>fundamental forecasting</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>market-based accounting.<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of the above</p>"
