      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">47:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Which of the following is not a forecasting technique mentioned in your text?</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Accounting-based forecasting<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Technical forecasting</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Fundamental forecasting<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Market-based forecasting</p>",
