      "text": "Câu 32: Vada, Inc. exports computers to Australia invoiced in U.S. dollars. Its main competitor is located in Japan. Vada is subject to:\nA. economic exposure. B. transaction exposure.\nC. translation exposure. D. economic and transaction exposure",
