      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">18:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>Assume that Parker Company will receive SF200,000 in 360 days. Assume the following interest rates:</p>\n<p><img class=\"card-image\" src=\"data/media/image8.jpeg\" alt=\"Hinh cau hoi\"></p>\n<p>Assume the forward rate of the Swiss franc is $.50 and the spot rate of the Swiss franc is $.48. If Parker Company uses a money market hedge, it will receive <span class=\"tab\"></span>in 360 days.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>$101,904<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>$101,923<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>$98,769<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>$96,914</p>",
