      "text": "Câu 26: The hedge is not a technique to eliminate transaction exposure discussed in the text.\nA. index B. futures C. forward D. money market",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 26: </span>The <span class=\"tab\"></span>hedge is not a technique to eliminate transaction exposure discussed in the text.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>index<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B. </span>futures<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>forward<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>money market</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 26: </span>The <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>hedge is not a technique to eliminate transaction exposure discussed in the text.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b u\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>index<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B. </span>futures<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>forward<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>money market</p>"
