      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu 36: </span>To hedge a <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>in a foreign currency, a firm may <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>a currency futures contract for that currency</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>receivable; purchase<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>payable; sell<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>payable; purchase<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of these</p>"
