      "text": "Câu 62: The price elasticity of demand for unique products tends to be\nA. highly elastic B. highly inelastic C. all of the above D. none of the above",
      "frontHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">62:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The price elasticity of demand for unique products tends to be</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>highly elastic<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>highly inelastic<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of the above<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p><span class=\"b\">Câu</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">62:</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>The price elasticity of demand for unique products tends to be</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">A.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>highly elastic<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b u\">B.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>highly inelastic<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">C.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>all of the above<span class=\"tab\"></span><span class=\"b\">D.</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>none of the above</p>"
