      "originalHtml": "<p>24: The main provision of the North American Free Trade Agreement (NAFTA) was that:</p>\n<p>the Mexican peso&#x27;s value be tied to the Canadian dollar.</p>\n<p>Mexico be allowed to privatize its business.</p>\n<p>Mexico must impose a minimum wage that is similar to the minimum wage in the U.S.</p>\n<p>none of the above</p>"
