      "text": "36: Assume that Boca Co. Wants to expand its business to Japan, and wants complete control over the operations in Japan. Which method of international business is most appropriate for Boca Co?\nA: Joint venture\nB: Partial acquisition of existing Japaneses firm C: Establishment of Japanese subsidiary\nD: Licensing",
