      "text": "38: The Sarbanes-Oxley Act improves corporate governance of MNCs because it A: places a limit on the amount of funds that managers can spend\nB: eliminates stock options as a form of compensation\nC: ties executive compensation to fỉm performance\nD: makes executives more accountable for verifying financial statements",
      "frontHtml": "<p>38: The Sarbanes-Oxley Act improves corporate governance of MNCs because it A: places a limit on the amount of funds that managers can spend</p>\n<p>B: eliminates stock options as a form of compensation</p>\n<p>C: ties executive compensation to fỉm performance</p>\n<p>D: makes executives more accountable for verifying financial statements</p>",
