      "context": "Chapter 4",
      "text": "7: Assume that Chinese corporations begin to purchase more supplies from Vietnam as a result of several labor strikes by Chinese suppliers. This action reflects?\nan increased demand for Chinese currency (CNY).\nan increase in the supply of Chinese currency (CNY)for sale.\na decrease in the demand for Chinese currency (CNY).\na decrease in the supply of Chinese currency (CNY) for sale.",
