      "originalHtml": "<p>30: If we have 2 put options that have the same maturity and premium, the more valuable one will have a</p>\n<p>A: larger St</p>\n<p>B: lower strike price C: <span class=\"b\">higher</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">strike</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">price</span><span class=\"b\"> </span>D: larger R$</p>"
