      "frontHtml": "<p>31: Mr Thinh wants to speculate on a rise in the value of the AUD. If his forecast is correct and the value of the AUD does indeed increase in the future, he would profit with</p>\n<p>A: a long position in a futures contract on the AUD B: a short position in a futures contract on the AUD C: a short position in a foward contract on the AUD D: None of the above</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p>31: Mr Thinh wants to speculate on a rise in the value of the AUD. If his forecast is correct and the value of the AUD does indeed increase in the future, he would profit with</p>\n<p>A: a long position in a futures contract on the AUD B: a short position in a futures contract on the AUD C: a short position in a foward contract on the AUD D: None of the above</p>"
