      "context": "Chapter 19: Trade finance",
      "text": "8: a) What is a name of a bill of exchange that requests a bank to pay the face amount at a future date?\ntime draft.\nletter of credit.\nsight draft.\nbanker's acceptance.\nb) What is a name of a bill of exchange that requests a bank to pay the face amount upon presentation of documents?\ntime draft.\nletter of credit.\nsight draft.\nbanker's acceptance.",
      "frontHtml": "<p>8: a) What is a name of a bill of exchange that requests a bank to pay the face amount at a future date?</p>\n<p>time draft.</p>\n<p>letter of credit.</p>\n<p>sight draft.</p>\n<p>banker&#x27;s acceptance.</p>\n<p>b) What is a name of a bill of exchange that requests a bank to pay the face amount upon presentation of documents?</p>\n<p>time draft.</p>\n<p>letter of credit.</p>\n<p>sight draft.</p>\n<p>banker&#x27;s acceptance.</p>",
