      "id": "q0733",
      "index": 733,
      "title": "12:",
      "context": "Chapter 19: Trade finance",
      "text": "12:\nUnder a letter of credit arrangement, the bank issuing the letter of credit is known as the bank, the correspondent bank in the beneficiary's country to which the issuing bank sends the letter of credit is known as the bank, and the bank that agrees to examine documents under the letter of credit and pay the beneficiary is called the bank\nadvising; negotiating; issuing\nnegotiating; issuing; advising\nadvising; issuing; negotiating\nissuing; advising; negotiating\nUnder a letter of credit arrangement, the bank issuing the letter of credit is known as the bank, the correspondent bank in the beneficiary's country to which the issuing bank sends the letter of credit is known as the bank, and the bank that agrees to examine documents under the letter of credit and pay the beneficiary is called the bank\nNone of above is correct\nadvising; issuing; negotiating\nnegotiating; issuing; advising\nissuing; negotiating; advising",
      "frontHtml": "<p>12:</p>\n<p>Under a letter of credit arrangement, the bank issuing the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"tab\"></span>bank, the correspondent bank in the beneficiary&#x27;s country to which the issuing bank sends the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"tab\"></span>bank, and the bank that agrees to examine documents under the letter of credit and pay the beneficiary is called the <span class=\"tab\"></span>bank</p>\n<p>advising; negotiating; issuing</p>\n<p>negotiating; issuing; advising</p>\n<p>advising; issuing; negotiating</p>\n<p>issuing; advising; negotiating</p>\n<p>Under a letter of credit arrangement, the bank issuing the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"tab\"></span>bank, the correspondent bank in the beneficiary&#x27;s country to which the issuing bank sends the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"tab\"></span>bank, and the bank that agrees to examine documents under the letter of credit and pay the beneficiary is called the <span class=\"tab\"></span>bank</p>\n<p>None of above is correct</p>\n<p>advising; issuing; negotiating</p>\n<p>negotiating; issuing; advising</p>\n<p>issuing; negotiating; advising</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p>12:</p>\n<p>Under a letter of credit arrangement, the bank issuing the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>bank, the correspondent bank in the beneficiary&#x27;s country to which the issuing bank sends the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>bank, and the bank that agrees to examine documents under the letter of credit and pay the beneficiary is called the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>bank</p>\n<p>advising; negotiating; issuing</p>\n<p>negotiating; issuing; advising</p>\n<p>advising; issuing; negotiating</p>\n<p>issuing; advising; negotiating</p>\n<p>Under a letter of credit arrangement, the bank issuing the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>bank, the correspondent bank in the beneficiary&#x27;s country to which the issuing bank sends the letter of credit is known as the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>bank, and the bank that agrees to examine documents under the letter of credit and pay the beneficiary is called the <span class=\"u\"><span class=\"tab\"></span></span>bank</p>\n<p>None of above is correct</p>\n<p>advising; issuing; negotiating</p>\n<p>negotiating; issuing; advising</p>\n<p>issuing; negotiating; advising</p>"
