      "frontHtml": "<p>20: Vietjet ships the container of Vinfast cars to the importer while still retaining actual title to the cars. What is the name of this trade finance service? Vietjet vận chuyển container ô tô Vinfast cho nhà nhập khẩu mà vẫn giữ nguyên quyền thực tế cho ô tô</p>\n<p>a letter of credit arrangement</p>\n<p>a draft arrangement</p>\n<p>a consignment arrangement</p>\n<p>an open account arrangement</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p>20: Vietjet ships the container of Vinfast cars to the importer while still retaining actual title to the cars. What is the name of this trade finance service? Vietjet vận chuyển container ô tô Vinfast cho nhà nhập khẩu mà vẫn giữ nguyên quyền thực tế cho ô tô</p>\n<p>a letter of credit arrangement</p>\n<p>a draft arrangement</p>\n<p>a consignment arrangement</p>\n<p>an open account arrangement</p>"
