      "question": "Câu 53: Which following opinion is NOT correct about CIF Bangkok port, Thailand (Incoterms 2010)?",
      "text": "Câu 53: Which following opinion is NOT correct about CIF Bangkok port, Thailand (Incoterms 2010)?\nA. The seller has obligation to make a contract of insurance of the goods.\nB. All risks of the goods are transferred in export country.\nC. The buyer has not obligation to make a contract of carriage.\nD. Bangkok port is the port of shipment.",
