      "frontHtml": "<p>Câu 53: Which following opinion is NOT correct about CIF Bangkok port, Thailand (Incoterms 2010)?</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p>Câu 53: Which following opinion is NOT correct about CIF Bangkok port, Thailand (Incoterms 2010)?</p>\n<p>The seller has obligation to make a contract of insurance of the goods.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">All</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">risks</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">of</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">the</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">goods</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">are</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">transferred</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">in</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">export</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">country.</span></p>\n<p>The buyer has not obligation to make a contract of carriage.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b hl\">Bangkok</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">port</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">is</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">the</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">port</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">of</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">shipment.</span></p>"
