      "frontHtml": "<p>Câu 54: Which the following opinion is correct about the method of documentary credit?</p>",
      "originalHtml": "<p>Câu 54: Which the following opinion is correct about the method of documentary credit?</p>\n<p>The exporter sends commercial documents directly to the importer.</p>\n<p><span class=\"b hl\">The</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">banks</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">must</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">undertake</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">to</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">honour</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">to</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">the</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">beneficiary</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">if</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">the</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">beneficiary</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">presents</span><span class=\"b hl\"> </span><span class=\"b hl\">complying</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">documents.</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"b\">The</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">banks</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">check</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">the</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">documents</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">according</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">to</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">the</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">sales</span><span class=\"b\"> </span><span class=\"b\">contract.</span></p>"
